# Project context

- Full map: `docs/DOMAINS.md`
- This repo: **Burn & Build** — desktop web product on **burnandbuilddiet.com**

Push to `main` deploys the static site via GitHub Pages.

## Paths

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `/` (`index.html`) | Marketing landing |
| `/questionnaire/` | Program questionnaire → Burn Engine → server save → checkout |
| `/createyourfoodplan/` | Stripe checkout + purchaser download portal (to reconnect) |
| `/purchase-email-preview/` | Purchase autosend email HTML preview (Safari review) |
| `server/pdf/` | PDFKit Burn & Build Diet renderer (`renderSampleDietPrintout.js`) |
| `js/` | Burn Engine, printout payloads, program package data |

**Product name:** Burn & Build Diet (never “meal planner” in user-facing copy).

## Active product flow

```
Landing (/) → /questionnaire/ → [checkout TBD] → Burn & Build Diet PDF
```

**Build my program** on the review step runs the Burn Engine, POSTs to `/api/programs`, and saves `bnb_program_draft` in `sessionStorage` before redirecting to `/createyourfoodplan/` for Stripe checkout.

## Questionnaire (workroom — clean build)

Restored `intake-acc` accordion UI. **One stylesheet only** — no legacy dark-theme CSS, no second CSS file.

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Markup | `questionnaire/index.html` — `q-app--workroom`, six steps, `intake-acc` fields |
| Logic | `questionnaire/js/questionnaire.js` — step nav, accordion Tab/click flow, `buildProgram()` |
| Styles | `questionnaire/css/questionnaire.css` — mobile-first workroom theme (`system-ui`) |

**JS imports:** `js/profileDataEngine.js`, `js/programPackageData.js`, `js/intakeQuestionCopyData.js`, `js/answersConfirmationPrintout.js`.

**Validation:** step Next highlights missing fields (red border); Review links jump to each question.

**Naming:** user-facing **questionnaire**; saved answers on the package object are `pkg.intake`. CSS classes `intake-form__*`, `intake-acc__*` are internal markup — not user-facing labels (see `.cursor/rules/product-terminology.mdc`).

**Do not reintroduce:** `intake-form.css`, Barlow/Google font links, `#welcome` hash routing, hidden motto markup, or the old dark `questionnaire.css` wireframe.

## File naming (role suffix)

Every `js/` file name ends with its job:

| Suffix | Meaning | Examples |
|--------|---------|----------|
| **Engine** | Math / computation | `burnEngine.js`, `profileDataEngine.js` |
| **Data** | Structured objects, constants, copy strings | `programPackageData.js`, `sampleDietPrintoutCopyData.js` |
| **Helpers** | Small utility functions | `programClientDataHelpers.js`, `dietPdfNamingHelpers.js` |
| **Printout** | One PDF section payload | `servingsPrintout.js`, `answersConfirmationPrintout.js` |
| **Fixtures** | Test / preview sample inputs | `sampleDietPreviewFixtures.js`, `printoutVerifyFixtures.js` |

