## Verify (engine + PDF)

```
npm run verify:printout-calcs
npm run verify:pdf
```

## Burn & Build Diet PDF

Renderer: `server/pdf/renderSampleDietPrintout.js` (PDFKit). Purchased PDF via `GET /api/programs/diet-pdf`; landing sample via `GET /api/samples/hardkor-sample-diet`.

**Visual style:** modern gold/black Montserrat report — Food Plan page is the design reference. See `.cursor/rules/modern-pdf-style.mdc`.

**HARDKOR Diet FAQ:** `GET /api/samples/hardkor-diet-faq` — separate from the diet PDF. See `.cursor/rules/burn-and-build-faq-pdf.mdc`.

**Purchase email:** sent via Resend after checkout; preview at `/purchase-email-preview/`. See `.cursor/rules/burn-and-build-purchase-email.mdc`.

## B&B Sample Diet PDF (landing page)

Live-rendered on Render from `docs/samples/hardkor-sample-diet.pdf` (static). Live DB fallback via `publicSampleDiet.js` if the file is missing. See `.cursor/rules/sample-diet-pdf.mdc`.

